  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentFinishedTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te tatū i tō pūrere
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentFinishedLeadText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He meneti torutoru noa ka tūhono ki tō kura ki tō wāhi mahi rānei. Ākuanei ka tatū katoa ngā taupānga kamupene, ngā tautuhinga whatunga, pūkete īmēra, kaupapahere haumarutanga, me ētahi atu tautuhinga nā tō kura, tō wāhi mahi rānei i tatū mōu, i tō pūrere. Mēnā kāore koe e āhei ki te uru i muri i te tāringa mō ētahi meneti, whakatuwheratia te taupānga Ngā Tautuhinga ka tīpako ai i Ngā Pūkete  > Uru ki te mahi ki te kura rānei  > Mōhiohio  > Tukutahi.
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentErrorFinishedTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I pā mai he raruraru
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentErrorFinishedLeadText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I puta he raruraru me te rēhita i tō pūrere ki tō kura, wāhi mahi rānei.
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollerLeadText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Taihoa kia rēhita mātou i tēnei pūrere ki tō kamupene me te hoatu i ngā kaupapahere e tika ana.
